{"resourceIdentifier":"2651","resourceName":"HENAN SONGXIAN AFFORESTATION PROJECT","description":"Henan Songxian Afforestation Project (hereafter referred as “the project”) is located in Song County, Luoyang City, Henan Province, China. The project is to establish forest on the barren land to generate GHG emission reductions and contribute to local sustainable development. The project is 23,999.20 ha of forest was established by direct planted on barren lands in Song County, Luoyang City, Henan Province.\r\nThe project activity aims to:\r\n- Sequester carbon dioxide and mitigating climate change;\r\n- Enhance biodiversity conservation by increasing the connectivity of forests;\r\n- Improve the quality and quantity of the vegetation;\r\n- Improve soil and water conservation and contribute to sustainable development.\r\n- Generate income and job opportunities for local communities.\r\nThere is no natural renewal and reforestation and all sites were barren hills at least 10 years prior to the implementation of the project. The main objective specie are Platycladus,Oak Tree and Hard broad which are native species. \r\nWith the implementation of the project activity, total GHG emission reductions or removals are about 28,606,632 tCO2e in 60 years the average annual emission reduction is 476,777 tCO2e and total GHG emission reductions or removals with buffer deduction is about 25,745,969 tCO2e in 60 years, the average annual GHG emission reductions or removals with buffer deduction is 429,099 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":33.549996,"longitude":111.666666},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-11-22","endExclusive":"2021-12-23","endInclusive":"2021-12-22"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2651"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","valu